{
    "title": "DMV Permit Practice Test 2024",
    "description": "DMV Permit Practice Test 2024 App prepares knowledge written tests for a driver's license including Cars, Commercial Vehicles and Motorcycles. Well-designed learning courses and updated permit practice tests are available for drivers.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The application is designed to provide training courses for those learners who prepare for their driver permit tests. This app is not affiliated with and does not represent the DMV or any Department of Motor Vehicles, or any federal, state, county, or city government, or any department, bureau, division, or agency of any governmental body in the United States and it does not replace official state-specific DMV applications.  \r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\r\nLEARN DRIVING RULES CARS, COMMERCIAL VEHICLES, MOTORCYCLES\r\n\u2705 Illustrated images and handbook reference for each question\r\n\u2705 Easy-to-learn roadmap\r\n\u2705 Check passing probability\r\n\u2705 Knowledge covers US traffic laws\r\n\r\nREVIEW LEARNING PROGRESS\r\n\u2705 Bookmark difficult questions\r\n\u2705 Ask driving instructors\r\n\u2705 Review most missed questions\r\n\r\nTAKE PRACTICE TESTS 2024\r\n\u2705 Exam-like questions\r\n\u2705 Practice tests with time limits\r\n\r\nDrivers Permit Practice Test App is for you if you're:\r\n\u2022 A teenager getting your first learner's permit\r\n\u2022 An adult is relocating to a new state.\r\n\u2022 A new resident in the United States.\r\n\u2022 A Commercial Driver's License (CDL) applicant.\r\n\u2022 A Motorcycle rider applicant.\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE in Alabama (AL), Alaska (AK), Arizona (AZ), Arkansas (AR), California (CA), Colorado (CO), Connecticut (CT), Delaware (DE), Florida (FL), Georgia (GA), Hawaii (HI), Idaho (ID), Illinois (IL), Indiana (IN), Iowa (IA), Kansas (KS), Kentucky (KY), Louisiana (LA), Maine (ME), Maryland (MD), Massachusetts (MA), Michigan (MI), Minnesota (MN), Mississippi (MS), Missouri (MO), Montana (MT), Nebraska (NE), Nevada (NV), New Hampshire (NH), New Jersey (NJ), New Mexico (NM), New York (NY), North Carolina (NC), North Dakota (ND), Ohio (OH), Oklahoma (OK), Oregon (OR), Pennsylvania (PA), Rhode Island (RI), South Carolina (SC), South Dakota (SD), Tennessee (TN), Texas (TX), Utah (UT), Vermont (VT), Virginia (VA), Washington (WA), West Virginia (WV), Wisconsin (WI) and Wyoming (WY)\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://mydmv.app/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use: https://mydmv.app/terms\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The application is designed to provide training courses for those learners who prepare for their driver permit tests. This app is not affiliated with and does not represent the DMV or any Department of Motor Vehicles, or any federal, state, county, or city government, or any department, bureau, division, or agency of any governmental body in the United States and it does not replace official state-specific DMV applications.  \r\n\r\nReference information. For more details about driver licenses and handbooks, please visits DMV's or State's websites at\r\nhttps://www.dmv.ca.gov/\r\nhttps://dmv.ny.gov/\r\nhttps://www.flhsmv.gov/\r\nhttps://www.revenue.alabama.gov/\r\nhttps://dds.georgia.gov/\r\nhttps://www.dmv.virginia.gov/\r\nhttps://www.dmv.pa.gov/\r\nhttps://www.bmv.ohio.gov/\r\nhttps://nj.gov/mvc/\r\nhttp://www.txdmv.gov/\r\nhttps://www.ncdot.gov/\r\nhttps://mva.maryland.gov/\r\nhttps://portal.ct.gov/\r\nhttps://www.ilsos.gov/\r\nhttps://www.in.gov/bmv/\r\nhttps://www.mass.gov/\r\nhttps://dps.mn.gov/\r\nhttps://dol.wa.gov/\r\nhttps://dmv.nv.gov/\r\nhttps://www.tn.gov/\r\nhttps://azdot.gov/\r\nhttps://scdmvonline.com/\r\nhttps://drive.ky.gov/\r\nhttps://dor.mo.gov/\r\nhttps://www.oregon.gov/\r\nhttps://dmv.colorado.gov/\r\nhttps://www.michigan.gov/\r\nhttps://www.ms.gov/\r\nhttps://wisconsindot.gov/\r\nhttps://mydmv.arkansas.gov/\r\nhttps://dmv.de.gov/\r\nhttps://oklahoma.gov/\r\nhttps://dmv.utah.gov/\r\nhttps://iowadot.gov/\r\nhttps://www.ksrevenue.gov/\r\nhttps://itd.idaho.gov/\r\nhttps://www.honolulu.gov/\r\nhttps://transportation.wv.gov/\r\nhttps://offices.omv.la.gov/",
